1 दृ दृणा॑ति (द॑र्षि), pp. दीर्ण॑ burst, break asunder,
split open (tr. & intr.);
 P. दीर्य॑ते (˚ति) the same (intr.). C.
दर॑यति & दारयति (˚ते) = S. tr. + drive asunder, disperse,
scatter. I. (st. दर्दृ & दादृ) = S. tr. —अव S. & C. split,
break, burst asunder (tr.);
 P. the same (intr.). आ split, go asunder;
also = I. rend, break, open, make accessible. निस् S. & C. rend, split,
cleave. परि M. rend on all sides, P. peel or drop off on all sides
(skin). प्र break, tear;
 P. split, open, burst asunder (intr.). वि
split, tear, rend asunder, open;
 P. burst, go asunder;
 C. rend or saw in
pieces, break through, open, drive asunder, chase away;
 I. split, open
(tr.). — Cf. अवदीर्ण, प॑रिदीर्ण, विदीर्ण.
